          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಗ್ರಂಥ — grantha — \"a treatise; a book\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಜ್ಜನ ಮನೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ತುಂಬಾ ಹಳೆಯ ಗ್ರಂಥಗಳು ಇವೆ. ajjana maneyalli tumbā haḷeya granthagaḷu ive. Grandfather's house has many old books."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ಗ್ರಂಥಗಳು, granthagaḷu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A weighty or old book. ಗ್ರಂಥಾಲಯ, a library."
            }
          ]
        },
