          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಗ್ರಂಥ (grantha) is borrowed from Sanskrit grantha, \"a knot\", and later \"a book\" (CDIAL 4350), from granth, \"to tie\"."
            }
